@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 42
title SA-RV03 — current analysis position
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Current documented candidate\nAccepted scope/core + proposed detail\nIdentified by fresh source hashes" as Candidate
rectangle "Populated working models\n03–10 and 12–14\nClass/data/interaction/state/activity/rule/contracts" as Done
rectangle "Remaining exact review\nCriterion/path/policy residuals\nActual dependent evidence and scoped acceptance" as Work #FFF3DF
rectangle "Continuation verdict\nContinue scoped analysis\nWhole-phase acceptance not established" as Verdict #DFF1EA
Candidate --> Done : inspect actual artifacts
Candidate --> Work : retain concrete gaps
Done --> Verdict : supports continuation
Work --> Verdict : limits completion claim
note bottom of Verdict
15 has no measured current-process study.
OAuth/backups/isolation gates remain scoped.
No product implementation is started here.
end note

@enduml
